abstract: "A high-performance Python tool for computing exact Goldbach partition numbers g(2n), capable of calculating continuous ranges from 2 to 10^14 using optimized segmented sieve algorithms with Numba JIT compilation and parallel processing. Provides verified data for even numbers ranging from 10^8 to 10^14."    title: "OEIS A045917"
    database: "The On-Line Encyclopedia of Integer Sequences"
    url: "https://oeis.org/A045917"